{
  "document_path": "docs/08-memory-model.md",
  "units": [
    {
      "unit_id": "u0001",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 1,
      "source_text": "# Chron-LLM Memory Model Specification\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0002",
      "line_start": 3,
      "line_end": 4,
      "source_text": "**Status:** Normative\n**Version:** R1\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0003",
      "line_start": 6,
      "line_end": 6,
      "source_text": "# Purpose\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0004",
      "line_start": 8,
      "line_end": 8,
      "source_text": "This specification defines the deterministic memory architecture used by Chron-LLM.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0005",
      "line_start": 10,
      "line_end": 10,
      "source_text": "# Memory Layers\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0006",
      "line_start": 12,
      "line_end": 12,
      "source_text": "The runtime defines three logical memory layers.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0007",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 14,
      "source_text": "## Short-Term Memory\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0008",
      "line_start": 16,
      "line_end": 16,
      "source_text": "Stores the most recent committed Events.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0009",
      "line_start": 18,
      "line_end": 18,
      "source_text": "Characteristics\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0010",
      "line_start": 20,
      "line_end": 22,
      "source_text": "- bounded\n- replayable\n- deterministic\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0011",
      "line_start": 24,
      "line_end": 26,
      "source_text": "```\nShortTermMemory := History[last N Events]\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0012",
      "line_start": 28,
      "line_end": 28,
      "source_text": "## Long-Term Memory\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0013",
      "line_start": 30,
      "line_end": 30,
      "source_text": "Stores persistent knowledge.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0014",
      "line_start": 32,
      "line_end": 32,
      "source_text": "Characteristics\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0015",
      "line_start": 34,
      "line_end": 36,
      "source_text": "- implementation-defined storage\n- mutable only through Commit when represented as Canonical Memory\n- replay compatible\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0016",
      "line_start": 38,
      "line_end": 38,
      "source_text": "## Canonical Memory\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0017",
      "line_start": 40,
      "line_end": 40,
      "source_text": "CanonicalMemory is the authoritative memory referenced by the runtime.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0018",
      "line_start": 42,
      "line_end": 42,
      "source_text": "Only Commit may modify CanonicalMemory.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0019",
      "line_start": 44,
      "line_end": 44,
      "source_text": "# MemoryRef\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0020",
      "line_start": 46,
      "line_end": 46,
      "source_text": "MemoryRef identifies memory visible to Replay and Prompt Builder.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0021",
      "line_start": 48,
      "line_end": 55,
      "source_text": "```\nMemoryRef :=\n{\nshort-term\nlong-term\ncanonical\n}\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0022",
      "line_start": 57,
      "line_end": 57,
      "source_text": "# Intent Semantics\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0023",
      "line_start": 59,
      "line_end": 59,
      "source_text": "## memory-read\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0024",
      "line_start": 61,
      "line_end": 66,
      "source_text": "```\nDerived.MemoryRef\n│\n▼\nPrompt\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0025",
      "line_start": 68,
      "line_end": 68,
      "source_text": "No mutation occurs.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0026",
      "line_start": 70,
      "line_end": 70,
      "source_text": "## memory-write\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0027",
      "line_start": 72,
      "line_end": 82,
      "source_text": "```\nCommit(Event)\n\n↓\n\nCanonicalMemory++\n\n↓\n\nMemoryRef updated\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0028",
      "line_start": 84,
      "line_end": 84,
      "source_text": "Only Commit may update CanonicalMemory and MemoryRef.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0029",
      "line_start": 86,
      "line_end": 86,
      "source_text": "## recover\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0030",
      "line_start": 88,
      "line_end": 88,
      "source_text": "Recovery includes MemoryRef during Prefill reconstruction.\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0031",
      "line_start": 90,
      "line_end": 97,
      "source_text": "```\nReplay\n│\nMemoryRef\n│\n▼\nPrefill\n```\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0032",
      "line_start": 99,
      "line_end": 99,
      "source_text": "# Invariants\n"
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "u0033",
      "line_start": 101,
      "line_end": 105,
      "source_text": "- Only Commit updates CanonicalMemory.\n- Only Commit updates authoritative MemoryRef.\n- MemoryRef is deterministic.\n- MemoryRef participates in Replay.\n- MemoryRef is replayable."
    }
  ]
}
